<p>On top of that, the build-up here is constant but doesn't really pay off. I get that there is a disaster looming for Site-41, (or that a disaster hit Site-41 as the ending seems to imply) but the fact that you wholesale redact the final punch just takes all the wind out of your sails and leaves me shrugging and feeling like my time has been slightly waisted.</p>
